<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican special forces raided a home in northern Sinaloa and captured cartel leader El Chapo Isidro, using U.S. surveillance drones and intelligence, without agents on site. Soldiers were attacked during the raid, resulting in eleven deaths and vehicles set ablaze on a highway, and the operation disrupted a local baseball match. The United States flew surveillance drones over Mexico to assist the capture and has requested extradition of El Chapo Isidro. The raid has triggered a risk of a violent succession battle within the cartel. 37 battle-related deaths were recorded in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/21/world/americas/mexico-el-chapo-isidro-drug-kingpin.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNVTE3aHliRkxuTkV1MXB3TG1VVkc1TnlhWUZnZ29oX3RtRXpxY0taMGt0ZnRwX3VycGg2QW1ndWkwMEM0ZjlVYUFhcjZCcHBISEFSNmdWVkdvNnRNS1dQcF9mQ3E2TDQtbnNsQjJjTVBuOG5LY2ZkTTJZZ25GS19Jdnp5NmpablRRcFJrdm93SnZmdDFnemxiRzZfNHhMbW5WeHc3eUNzd0hVenc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/cm62p9y3y04qo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPLTRRZGRaTmQ5V3hXTXBBLW1FelBVSGs3NVo3eVR2R0ZxNkoxSzBlRDVxU0szMUhqQTJ4VktoQWFkeWNMN2gyNVY0OUxKVDdjTElxU3FJN1ZXZm9TS3BwMkwxTUdCQUpKdU9IZlJiNHhSOFEzVlNLZE94djg3ZUlPTmpFeDZKZEVmNkluT05fVE42Mms4ZFNhZXdwbUhMVHZxWlM0VE9sVXBMeVJwdFNHYjh4X09ZWmtrc2Njb2RDRWJaOEdI?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQdnIxT1p6ZGRtTS1kSFRsc29RcFRqeTFkUlBHMHdZVjNPNHhzVEZYajI4bmtV